GatewayId.description:
Stable gateway identifier (e.g., "GW-MENON-001"). Required;
must be unique across the customer's fleet. Used as a foundational
identity key in canonical points, diagnostics, and license binding.

WatchdogSettings.description:
Watchdog configuration controlling whether the host process restarts
itself on unrecoverable failure. Implementation is a Phase 4 host concern;
this record is the JSON-loadable shape only.
